<h1 id="mdpdf-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0"><code>mdpdf</code> — Markdown + Mermaid → PDF</h1>

**Purpose:** When the user asks to turn a **`.md`** (with **` ```mermaid `** fences) into a **`.pdf`**, run a reliable conversion so diagrams appear as graphics, not raw code.

**Trigger:** User says **`mdpdf`**, “convert this md to pdf”, “export … to PDF”, or **`@mdpdf-markdown-mermaid-to-pdf`**.

**Portable:** Project-agnostic. Copy this file into any repo’s `.cursor/rules/`.

